  "output": {
    "answer": "That was me, not a team — the record only describes my own setup time, about half an hour a day, which is my estimate rather than a measurement, and it doesn't count the mornings I spent reading results. The hundred experiments in two weeks ran unattended in worktrees, many overnight, gated so they didn't need me watching. Whether a part-time team could hit the same pace isn't something the record addresses at all — it only speaks to my own time on this project.",
